70f309870b2","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"1783-208c-59e9-4096"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nStory anguished-grown-junebug (1783-208c-59e9-4096) removed the visual workflow editor but deliberately left `pyproject.toml` untouched. `scripts/dependency_audit.py:50` (`DEPENDENCY_MAP_FILES`) treats ANY edit to `pyproject.toml` as touching the dependency map (the deliberate, package-blind \"touch it, you own it\" rule from bug 63e8). The committed lock carries HIGH advisories tracked by unhelpful-supersmart-chrysalis (f7dc-132b-057a-476c), including one with no published fix. So the editor-removal change could not pass `pip-audit` with these edits in it. The leftovers are inert: the wheel builds with 0 editor files with them present.\n\n## Approach\nOnce f7dc-132b-057a-476c has cleared the lock advisories, remove the 4 stale hunks in one change. This change touches the dependency map, so `pip-audit` must be green on its patchset.\n\n## Scope\nEdit `pyproject.toml` only (line numbers on origin/main b97d414b8e2):\n1. `:370-373` — the comment block and `\"src/rebar/llm/workflow/editor_assets/dist/**/*\",` entry in `[tool.hatch.build.targets.wheel].artifacts` (the editor bundle glob).\n2. `:382-383` comment and `:388` `\"**/node_modules\",` in the wheel `exclude` list.\n3. `:403` `\"**/node_modules\",` in the sdist `exclude` list.\n4. `:743` the `e2e:` entry in `[tool.pytest.ini_options].markers`, plus the `:550` comment `(prompt_authoring/snapshot) carry justified noqas` reworded to name only the remaining snapshot site.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `git grep -n -E 'editor_assets|prompt_authoring|node_modules|\"e2e:' -- pyproject.toml` prints nothing.\n- [ ] `uv build --wheel` succeeds and `unzip -l dist/*.whl | grep -c editor_assets` prints `0`.\n- [ ] The Gerrit change reaches `Verified +1` with the `pip-audit` job green, and `LLM-Review +1`.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","f041-4a84-fcdf-405a"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"f041-4a84-fcdf-405a","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"3360-ba7a-7e72-4ccc","ticket_type":"task","title":"Drop 4 stale editor references from pyproject.toml once lock advisories are resolved","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["93c66c24-f604-450d-a971-eca010598f0d","72d44c15-c9af-4635-9017-c70f309870b2","9849dfba-c49c-4479-9520-33ea678b214c"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1792380015397089001,"uuid":"da2c976c-d530-4f4a-ae08-35a9cefbc598"}